flowchart TD
    R[Reset at 0x08000000] --> C[Bootloader SystemInit]
    C --> L[PC13 startup window]
    L --> V[Read application MSP and reset vector at 0x08006000]
    V --> Q{Vectors valid?}
    Q -->|No| E[Repeat coded LED error]
    Q -->|Yes| S[Stop SysTick and clear NVIC]
    S --> D[RCC DeInit]
    D --> T[Set VTOR to 0x08006000]
    T --> H[Assembly handoff: set MSP and reset masks]
    H --> A[Branch to application Reset_Handler]
    A --> I[Application SystemInit]
    I --> Y[Application SysTick heartbeat]
